persistence across page refreshes.\n   - User profile customization with currency selection (`$`, `€`, `£`, `₹`, `C$`, `A$`, `¥`, `CHF`).\n   - Strict user data isolation in persistent SQLite database (`data/household.db`).\n\n2. **Dashboard (Zero Dummy Data)**:\n   - Live KPI cards calculating Monthly Budget, Total Spent, Remaining Discretionary Balance, Unpaid/Overdue Bills, and Low Pantry Items.\n   - Urgent Alerts Banner highlighting overdue bills, immediate due dates, and pantry shortages.\n   - Monthly Spending Stream Distribution Pie Chart.\n\n3. **Bills & Rent Management**:\n   - Supports all 13 required categories: *Rent, Water bill, Electricity bill, Gas bill, Internet bill, School fees, College fees, University fees, Household help fees, Education fees, Household fees, Online shopping payments, Package amounts*.\n   - Dynamic status tracking (`Paid`, `Pending`, `Overdue`).\n   - Automated 7-tier bill reminder engine: **15 days**, **10 days**, **7 days**, **4 days**, **3 days**, **1 day**, and **hours left (due today)**.\n   - Monthly Bill Summary card and interactive Category Breakdown Pie Chart.\n\n4. **Expense Management**:\n   - Daily expense tracking across *Food, Transport, Utility, Other daily expenses*.\n   - Real-time instant search bar, date filtering, full CRUD operations, and category distribution pie chart.\n\n5. **Pantry Management & Market Purchases**:\n   - Inventory tracking with quantities, units, and minimum safety thresholds.\n   - One-click `+` / `-` stock adjustment controls and running-low alert banners.\n   - **Market Purchase Flow**: Allows purchasing items from market, which automatically updates pantry stock **and** logs the expenditure in the spending ledger.\n   - Dynamic Suggested Shopping List with replenishment counts and estimated restock costs.\n\n6. **Budget Management**:\n   - Configurable monthly household budget target.\n   - Real-time calculation: `Total Spent = Paid Bills + Daily Expenses + Pantry Purchases`.\n   - **Budget-Running-Low Alert** (triggers at 80%+ budget utilization) and **Saving Alert** (triggers when budget is exceeded).\n\n7. **AI Intelligence Suite**:\n   - **AI Assistant**: Conversational assistant embedded with live context of your actual database records.\n   - **Smart Recommendations**: Evaluates actual user metrics and presents prioritized actionable guidance.\n   - **AI Summary**: Generates executive briefings on financial health and pantry stock.\n   - **AI-Generated Pie Chart**: Dynamic visualization synthesizer creating customized pie charts based on natural language queries.\n\n8. **Data Visualizations (Strictly Pie Charts Only)**:\n   - Exclusively Pie Charts with responsive SVG arcs, hover tooltips, center KPI metrics, and legend toggles.\n   - Month-over-Month comparison pie charts.\n\n9. **Design System & Real Notifications**:\n   - ☀️ **Light Mode** & 🌙 **Dark Mode** with persistent theme storage.\n   - 100% responsive across mobile, tablet, laptop, and desktop.\n   - Real in-app notification center drawer with live badge count.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Accessing the Live Application\n\nThe server is running live:\n- **Application URL**: `http://localhost:5000`\n- **Project Directory**: `C:\\Users\\HP\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\household-app`\n\nTo start or restart the server at any time:\n```powershell\ncd C:\\Users\\HP\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\household-app\nnpm start\n```"}
