-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight\">\n93:             Expense Management\n94:           </h1>\n95:           <p className=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1\">\n96:             Track and search daily expenses across Food, Transport, Utilities, and custom categories.\n97:           </p>\n98:         </div>\n99: \n100:         <div className=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n101:           <input\n102:             type=\"month\"\n103:             value={monthFilter}\n104:             onChange={(e) => setMonthFilter(e.target.value)}\n105:             className=\"px-3 py-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-xs font-semibold focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-emerald-500\"\n106:           />\n107:           <button\n108:             onClick={() => {\n109:               setEditingExpense(null);\n110:               setIsModalOpen(true);\n111:             }}\n112:             className=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-500 text-white transition-colors shadow-sm\"\n113:           >\n114:             <Plus className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n115:             <span>Add Expense</span>\n116:           </button>\n117:         </div>\n118:       </div>\n119: \n120:       {/* Summary KPI & Category Distribution Pie Chart */}\n121:       <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6\">\n122:         <div className=\"lg:col-span-4 p-6 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 shadow-xs flex flex-col justify-between\">\n123:           <div>\n124:             <span className=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">\n125:               Total Expenses Recorded\n126:             </span>\n127:             <div className=\"mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-2\">\n128:               <span